[en.FOCUS_C01_C02_LOYALTY_TEST]
Loyalty Test

[en.FOCUS_C01_C02_LOYALTY_TEST_desc]
Trixie and Starlight Glimmer once had a friendship, although we have no evidence to suggest that they are still in contact now, nor do we have any evidence that they did anything together during the Ultimate Battle.\nHowever, the concerns of the Empress Cozy Glow are not groundless. Now, a test, or a chance to get rid of Trixie once and for all, has come.\nStarlight Glimmer is training troops in various major cities in the east of Equestria like Baltimare, preparing for the war against the Empire. We will ask Trixie to strike Starlight before she is ready.\nIf Trixie is perfunctory, we will have enough reason to dismiss her for her incompetence or even betrayal; if Trixie seriously executes our orders, it will prove her loyalty, but when the armies of Ponyville and Starlight are both tired, the Empire will come to clean up everything.

[en.FOCUS_C01_C02_LOYALTY_TEST_TOOLTIP]
§Y[C02.GetName]§! will declare war on §Y[C08.GetName]§! within §Y30§! days.

[en.FOCUS_C01_C02_LOYALTY_TEST_TRIGGER_TOOLTIP]
§Y[C08.GetName]§! is preparing for war against the Empire, giving us enough reason to order §Y[C02.GetName]§! to intervene.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C02_LOYALTY_TEST]
忠诚测试

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C02_LOYALTY_TEST_desc]
特丽克西与星光熠熠曾经有过一段友谊，虽然我们没有任何证据表明她们现在仍在联系，也没有任何证据证明她们曾经一起在终末之战期间做过什么。\n但是，和煦光流女皇的担忧并不是空穴来风，如今，一个测试，又或者说，一劳永逸解决掉特丽克西的机会来了。\n星光熠熠正在巴尔的马和小马利亚东部的各个大城市练兵，准备对帝国的战争。我们将要求特丽克西在星光准备好之前突袭星光。\n如果特丽克西敷衍了事，我们将有足够的理由因她的渎职甚至背叛而罢免她；如果特丽克西在认真执行我们的命令，那将证明她的忠诚，但当小马谷的军队与星光的军队两败俱伤时，帝国将来清扫一切。

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C02_LOYALTY_TEST_TOOLTIP]
§Y[C02.GetName]§!将在§Y30§!天内向§Y[C08.GetName]§!宣战。

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C02_LOYALTY_TEST_TRIGGER_TOOLTIP]
§Y[C08.GetName]§!正在准备对帝国的战争，让我们有足够的借口命令§Y[C02.GetName]§!进行干涉。

